                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: I take pleasure in
                    communicating to you the inclosed memorandum in reply to the pro memoriâ you
                    left with me on the 3d instant.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay</hi>.</signed></closer>



